/-
# The braid group for Kourovka Notebook WantedExt statements

The braid group `Bₙ` on `n` strands, shared by the entries for Problems 1.11, 10.23 and 14.102: the
Artin group (`CoxeterMatrix.ArtinGroup` of `MathlibExt.GroupTheory.ArtinGroup`) of the Coxeter
matrix of type `A_{n-1}` (Mathlib's `CoxeterMatrix.A (n - 1)`). This is Artin's presentation: the
generators `σ₁, …, σₙ₋₁` (indexed by `Fin (n - 1)`) with `σᵢ σⱼ = σⱼ σᵢ` for `|i - j| > 1` and
`σᵢ σⱼ σᵢ = σⱼ σᵢ σⱼ` for `|i - j| = 1`.
-/

module

public import MathlibExt.GroupTheory.ArtinGroup

@[expose] public section

namespace MathlibExt.GroupTheory.BraidGroupShared

/-- The braid group `Bₙ` on `n` strands, by Artin's presentation: the Artin group of the Coxeter
matrix of type `A_{n-1}`, generated by `σ₁, …, σₙ₋₁` (`CoxeterMatrix.ArtinGroup.of`, indexed by
`Fin (n - 1)`). -/
abbrev BraidGroup (n : ℕ) : Type := (CoxeterMatrix.A (n - 1)).ArtinGroup

end MathlibExt.GroupTheory.BraidGroupShared
